Canonical commercial contracts for the partner/salesperson/influencer acceptance chain:
- PartnerApplication, PartnerApproval, PartnerReferral (immutable), BusinessEnrollment,
  Conversion, CommissionEarning, InfluencerEarning interfaces
- PartnerService: submitApplication, approveApplication, createReferral (immutable chain)
- EnrollmentService: enrollBusiness (idempotent), listBySalesperson, listByInfluencer
- CommissionEarningService: recordConversion with idempotency + Phase 06 canonical formula
  (salespersonShare = 100 + 75% × max(0, amount − 600), min 600 KES; influencerShare = 50 flat)
- 28 unit tests proving all 5 commercial invariants
- EntityKind union extended with businessEnrollment, commissionEarning, influencerEarning, conversion
- tsconfig.json: added partners project reference
- vitest.config.ts: added @soostori/partners path alias
- CHANGELOG updated for alpha.22

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
